Package: RcmdrShiny
Type: Package
Title: A Shiny Version of the R Commander
Version: 1.3.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("RcmdrShiny", "Contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "vigliafg@gmail.com"),
    person("John", "Fox", role = "ctb",
           comment = "Author of Rcmdr, from which this package is derived"),
    person("Milan", "Bouchet-Valat", role = "ctb",
           comment = "Author of Rcmdr, from which this package is derived")
  )
Description: A local, browser-based graphical user interface for basic
    statistics, derived from the R Commander (Rcmdr) engine and rebuilt on
    top of Shiny.  The package keeps the command-generation semantics of
    Rcmdr while removing the dependency on Tcl/Tk, so that every action in
    the interface produces a reproducible R command.
